{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.meishu.2019b.q20.material.recovered", "text": "周老师上抽象绘画课，在进入到艺术实践环节时，看到小明同学画得很慢，完成作业似有困难，于是拿过画笔，在小明的画纸上横涂坚抹，很快就把画面铺满，一幅色彩飞扬的画置现在小明面前。然后他对小明说：“你看哪些地方还需要补充和修改，你自己来完成吧。”直到下课交作业，小明也没再画上一笔。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》真题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "9e4782a22684edfe061dce33acc3eb6f06d8b04dfc34be43163d8a74f9a3799e", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1922, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2059, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》真题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 20, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "9e4782a22684edfe061dce33acc3eb6f06d8b04dfc34be43163d8a74f9a3799e"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.meishu.2019b.q20"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.meishu.s1.k03", "ntce.gaozhong.meishu.s1.k04", "ntce.gaozhong.meishu.s3.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.design", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.414.r020", "ntce.outline.414.r023"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.meishu.2019b.q20"], "word_count": 137, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "meishu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》真题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》真题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "9e4782a22684edfe061dce33acc3eb6f06d8b04dfc34be43163d8a74f9a3799e", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1922, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2059, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》真题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 20, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256