{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.meishu.2019b.q22.material.recovered", "text": "胡老师在完成“书法”模块教学后，举办了一个主题为“书写传统的”学生作品展览会，他要求学生将创作构思写在作品简介上，同时，他还举办了一个座谈会，邀请其他学科老师、家长代表和学生参加“我爱书法”的座谈会，大家分别谈了自己的看法……32（1）根据《普通高中美术课程标准》的评价建议，你觉得胡老师的这次教学合理之处并说明理由（10分）（2）你觉的胡老师用了哪些评价建议。（10分）四、教学设计题。请根据所提供的教学材料和相关情况，按要求完成教学设计。（本大题共1小题，共30分）", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》真题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "9e4782a22684edfe061dce33acc3eb6f06d8b04dfc34be43163d8a74f9a3799e", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2119, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2355, "next_source_question_number": 33, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》真题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 22, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "9e4782a22684edfe061dce33acc3eb6f06d8b04dfc34be43163d8a74f9a3799e"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.meishu.2019b.q22"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.meishu.s3.k01", "ntce.gaozhong.meishu.s3.k02", "ntce.gaozhong.meishu.s3.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.design"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.414.r020", "ntce.outline.414.r021", "ntce.outline.414.r023"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.meishu.2019b.q22"], "word_count": 235, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "meishu", "kind": "lesson_plan_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》真题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》真题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "9e4782a22684edfe061dce33acc3eb6f06d8b04dfc34be43163d8a74f9a3799e", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2119, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2355, "next_source_question_number": 33, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》真题（考生回忆版）.csv